WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.480
Generative AI produces new content from learned patterns and a request.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:10.960
A kitchen helper proposes a recipe using the ingredients available today.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:16.440
Grounding supplies trusted context so the draft can reflect the real situation.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:21.920
Validation checks structure, rules, and required details before anything moves on.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:27.400
A person confirms the final dish when the decision or risk calls for it.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.880
Generative AI can create fluently; a safe workflow makes facts, checks, and handoff visible.
